  <h2>Hoe installeer en configureer je rsyslog?</h2>

  <p>
    Installeer op de Linux-server die als collector zal fungeren rsyslog en schakel de ontvangst van externe logs in.
  </p>

  <div class="locked-code-block relative my-6">
    <div style="background:#0f1419;padding:16px;border-radius:8px;overflow-x:auto;filter:blur(3px);user-select:none;pointer-events:none;">
      <pre style="margin:0;"><code style="color: #e5e7eb;"># rsyslog installeren
apt update && apt install rsyslog -y

# /etc/rsyslog.conf bewerken en uncommenten:
module(load="imudp")
input(type="imudp" port="514")
module(load="imtcp")
input(type="imtcp" port="514")

# De service herstarten
systemctl restart rsyslog && systemctl enable rsyslog</code></pre>
    </div>
